 "strategy": "well i made this deck as my first deck more like my fun deck i know it would need some major work but tell me what u think. i thought if u have opponents with non-space themes ur jedi can walk around sweeping through. and in space well i added i guess enough to fight there too. use some of the inturupts and effects to alter or enhance ur destiny so anything in ur way can get plowed over, i hope it works my friend wants to make the deck but i need some help on ajusting it to hurt a lot more. most of the jedi should get there lightsabers when they come into play plus u can use some ships that are suped up to kill some other guys. the jedi's get there lightsabers and drain for a few. they might not get stepped up to unless someone has a army or dark jedi but u have destiny draws that are rediculous to not let em lose the fight",
